Z||000001||theogre||12-06-2000||08:50 PM||||I haven't installed them yet, but that means I have them nice and handy to compair side by side.<P>The actual slide portion is the same. The head is taller on the Fiero ones. That makes total intalled length a bit taller but not so it's a big deal.<P>No real reason to replace them if they are good. If the tops are even a little stripped looking replace them. the slides are only a few dollars. Not worth saving if damaged.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by theogre (edited 12-06-2000).]||||reg||1
